  "question": {
    "text": "If the number of integral solutions <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math> is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2.3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Each of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> can be permuted in <math><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></math> ways<br />Each of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> can be permuted in <math><mn>3</mn></math> ways<br />So, there are <math><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math> triplets <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Also, the signs are<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>–</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>–</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>–</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>–</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>–</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>–</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>+</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>,</mo></mrow></mfenced></math><br />So, the desired number is <math><mn>18</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>"
  }
}